  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/thompson1917-ch02-17> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch02-17--grok--data-existence> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch02-17--grok--data-adequacy> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
